{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Mr. Cattenheimer\n🐈 Father of Catty and Catti; missing his right arm, with no explanation in the game.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**🎲 The Shelter's 3 codes**\nHis house hides a 3-code lock identical in design to the one in the Shelter — a real parallel, but with no confirmation that it's intentional.","x":-680,"y":-640,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**🎲 The missing hand**\nCh.5 confirms that a cat bit Kris's hand. Cattenheimer is the only NPC who already shows on screen the result of losing a hand.","x":420,"y":-640,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Catti**\nHis younger daughter, classmate of Kris and Susie.","x":420,"y":260,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**The Ch.4 choir**\nSings in the church alongside Toriel, Shyren, and Noelle, while Kris and Susie investigate the Shelter's code.","x":-680,"y":260,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dad_Cat_overworld.webp","x":-145,"y":-400,"width":147,"height":180},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/cat_house_3_ codes_password.webp","x":-680,"y":-1000,"width":300,"height":210},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Pink_screenshot_cat_bite.png","x":420,"y":-1010,"width":300,"height":235},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Catti_overworld.webp","x":470,"y":470,"width":183,"height":260},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Toriel_sing_in_the_church.png","x":-925,"y":458,"width":200,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_codigos_mano","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_codigos_coro","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}